PORTFOLIO.md

# ==============================================================================
# Notes
# ==============================================================================
# VERSION and SHA256SUMS are deliberately NOT ignored: self-update refuses to
# install anything that is not listed in the committed SHA256SUMS, and
# tools/sync_version.sh reads VERSION as the single source of truth.
# Release artifacts (uploaded to GitHub Releases, not tracked)
dist/
